meta {
  name: Gun cue off
  type: http
  seq: 31
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/gunsound?on=0
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  200 { gunSound: false }

  Read-or-set, same shape as /beep and /bootsound. GET /gunsound reports
  the current value; POST /gunsound?on=1 re-enables.

  Stored under its own NVS key ("wifi"/"gunsnd"), NOT in the cfg blob.
  Default ON when the key is absent.

  Same setting as the "Gun cue : ON/OFF" row on the device CONFIG
  screen — either one updates the other. Audible confirmation on enable
  is the gun cue itself (short rising beep).
}
